{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"t":"PART 4","y":0.10021238031921875,"w":0.088275394439697258,"h":0.016145006771100978,"x":0.19029136843754998,"c":1},{"y":0.12936046488084185,"t":"Much of the world now lives in an industrial civilisation. But this has only become possible","h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"w":0.61937718709309897,"x":0.19204151015875615},{"w":0.63148788452148441,"h":0.01469559132260323,"x":0.19031142095568326,"t":"because we have the necessary natural resources. There are three types of natural resource","y":0.1452064378488569,"c":1},{"t":"without which industry could not exist. One of these is metal - without that we'd have no","x":0.18849293480690893,"h":0.019498654893430611,"c":1,"y":0.15876835976312575,"w":0.61954030354817702},{"c":1,"x":0.19031141402329013,"y":0.17877906988952108,"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.59861592610677083,"t":"machines and no transportation. Another is fossil fuels, which we need to power those"},{"c":1,"x":0.19031141187161532,"h":0.013296011196641033,"w":0.60553634643554699,"t":"machines. But there's a third resource that's essential to connect the different parts of a","y":0.19314205730980294},{"y":0.20923722887516427,"t":"machine together with belts and pipes and shock absorbers, and that is rubber. It's now","w":0.60899653116861974,"c":1,"x":0.18858131909624509,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"t":"used in over 40,000 products, from waterproof footwear to surgical gloves.","c":1,"y":0.2252906974387533,"x":0.1903114166572189,"w":0.52249135335286456,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"x":0.18854546063487107,"w":0.59696741739908854,"h":0.01883934693706879,"t":"At present, we have two types of rubber in common use. One is natural rubber, which","y":0.24852074720840134,"c":1},{"t":"nearly all comes from the Pará rubber tree. This was originally native to Brazil, but is now","y":0.26452064392633923,"h":0.016095171448565315,"w":0.61764704386393232,"x":0.18858132396768781,"c":1},{"t":"cultivated on plantations in South-East Asia. Recently, however, concern's been growing","y":0.28017980478085658,"c":1,"x":0.19026761793546484,"w":0.61080505371093752,"h":0.017473398346096736},{"h":0.016138908327501866,"t":"that supplies may soon be insufficient for the world's needs. So what exactly is limiting the","x":0.18858132547423528,"w":0.62629755655924479,"c":1,"y":0.29636109159057566},{"x":0.18821332674278418,"h":0.019616558803721262,"y":0.30990182823242163,"w":0.17893309275309244,"c":1,"t":"supply of natural rubber?"},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"Well, for one thing, rubber trees don't just spring up overnight. It can take eight to ten","y":0.33720930240064495,"w":0.60034601847330726,"c":1,"x":0.19031141973434654},{"y":0.35304408688011935,"x":0.18858131338873724,"t":"years for a tree to start producing rubber, so cultivating them's a slow process. And this","c":1,"w":0.60726643880208342,"h":0.01614195955141684},{"x":0.18685121591077622,"h":0.016095171448565426,"t":"leads to another problem. With most crops, farmers don't have to think very far ahead, so","y":0.36913925848406748,"w":0.62456746419270825,"c":1},{"t":"they can easily change what crop they produce, or how much of a crop they produce, if they","y":0.38361079129048015,"x":0.18854597060363973,"w":0.64021876017252599,"h":0.019005424414088146,"c":1},{"w":0.62647343953450518,"h":0.019673522991930481,"y":0.39798586183920648,"t":"find the demand for that crop is rising or falling. But if you have to plant eight or ten years","c":1,"x":0.18849260543177263},{"c":1,"t":"ahead, that's much harder. And also the rubber tree's very choosy about where it grows.","y":0.41707487728613635,"w":0.61591695149739589,"x":0.18858131654447599,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"y":0.43168604668161148,"w":0.60207611083984369,"x":0.18858132295378047,"c":1,"h":0.017579173441113483,"t":"It needs the right temperature, the right amount of rainfall, and the right altitude - not"},{"t":"too high and not too low. The result is that it can't be grown in the northern or southern","y":0.44758276036503919,"w":0.6125361633300781,"c":1,"x":0.18681323360144386,"h":0.017102461081438758},{"y":0.46361091662851606,"x":0.18858131721030938,"w":0.63148788452148441,"t":"parts of the globe, only around the equator. Another problem is that the rubber is basically","h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1},{"w":0.61937718709309897,"c":1,"h":0.016150096815895409,"t":"extracted in the same way as it's been done for hundreds of years, and that's by hand, by","y":0.47965116286068554,"x":0.18858130264557446},{"t":"making small cuts in the trunk of the tree, and putting a little cup there to catch the latex,","x":0.19031142963563069,"h":0.014534882851794828,"y":0.49563953513660253,"w":0.61937713623046875,"c":1},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"x":0.18858130889196123,"t":"as the rubber is called. It's very labour-intensive. And it's not just the initial production that's","y":0.51154653574147813,"w":0.63667821248372392},{"c":1,"h":0.016120599649267708,"x":0.18685121591204354,"t":"limiting supplies. With other resources such as water and glass, when we've finished using","y":0.52761627914507836,"w":0.62456746419270837},{"x":0.18858130834602624,"y":0.54360465123607082,"w":0.6211072794596354,"t":"them we can recycle them, but although this is also possible with rubber, it's very difficult,","c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"w":0.35492744445800778,"h":0.017281266006245466,"c":1,"t":"so that also reduces the amount we have available.","y":0.55691916245246698,"x":0.19020745594295779},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.5968858337402343,"c":1,"t":"And in the last few years, there have been new threats to the supply of natural rubber.","y":0.58284883697345746,"x":0.1903114082963781},{"w":0.60046915690104163,"t":"One problem is linked to the fact that nearly all the rubber trees in South-East Asia are","y":0.59755767407724947,"x":0.18852484834618527,"h":0.018673786673202075,"c":1},{"x":0.18858130886174534,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.61476557006199373,"w":0.63667821248372403,"t":"descended from just a small number of seeds brought from Brazil in the nineteenth century."},{"t":"This means that there's very little genetic diversity among the trees, which in turn makes","y":0.6322603217459023,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"w":0.61245676676432292,"x":0.18858130511013352},{"c":1,"w":0.61937718709309897,"t":"them very vulnerable to disease. The most dangerous threat is a fungus, which destroyed","x":0.18685119893577337,"y":0.64680232565204532,"h":0.015988371937820545},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"x":0.18685119874451753,"w":0.61937718709309897,"t":"large numbers of rubber trees in Brazil, and which could cause devastation to plantations","y":0.66270118984238024},{"y":0.67877906984256819,"w":0.59861592610677083,"t":"worldwide. Another problem is that farmers in South-East Asia are increasingly turning","h":0.01611246238478925,"x":0.18858131021731425,"c":1},{"h":0.019561109549520395,"y":0.69268655336696361,"c":1,"w":0.60048639933268233,"x":0.18678637257240061,"t":"to the cultivation of palm oil, which is easier and more profitable for them. And finally,"},{"t":"in recent years South-East Asia, like other parts of the world, has been repeatedly hit by","y":0.71063680895450776,"x":0.18685122103488652,"w":0.61072662353515628,"c":1,"h":0.016107377011597479},{"c":1,"y":0.72673198055706378,"x":0.18858131480977552,"w":0.5,"t":"extreme types of weather, and this looks likely to continue in the future.","h":0.016095171448565426},{"t":"However, as well as using natural rubber, it's also possible to make rubber synthetically. This","x":0.18858130890774846,"y":0.77180232565612106,"w":0.63667821248372392,"h":0.016161285304289064,"c":1},{"x":0.18858132528185961,"h":0.015988371937820545,"y":0.78779069774227084,"w":0.62629755655924479,"c":1,"t":"works very well for some purposes, for example, making engine parts, or silicone pots and"},{"h":0.01469559132260323,"y":0.80370888737611079,"c":1,"t":"pans used for cooking. But compared with natural rubber, it's not anything like as strong,","x":0.19031141458914647,"w":0.61418685913085935},{"h":0.016131788137661585,"w":0.58996541341145825,"x":0.18858130704693782,"c":1,"t":"and this means it can't replace natural rubber in other products. For example, while a","y":0.81976744193551243},{"y":0.83575581371828567,"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"mixture of natural rubber and synthetic rubber works well in car tyres, only natural rubber","x":0.19031142608469537,"c":1},{"w":0.55536331176757803,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"t":"can stand up to the extreme speeds of aircraft tyres during take-off and landing.","x":0.19031142368830861,"y":0.85164450648653778},{"x":0.18855083246135471,"w":0.60559987386067704,"h":0.015819319984644253,"y":0.87466741141909199,"t":"So for some time, scientists have been looking for alternative sources of natural rubber.","c":1},{"y":0.89244186058717545,"x":0.19031142034660795,"w":0.61591695149739578,"t":"One that's been known about for some time seems initially to be a rather unlikely source.","h":0.013086481141076356,"c":1},{"t":"It's a wild plant with yellow flowers that we normally regard as a weed when we see it in our","y":0.90692792169835101,"x":0.19031142667828096,"w":0.63321797688802084,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.92296511635314959,"w":0.61245676676432281,"t":"gardens. But when it's pulled up and its roots cut open, they're found to contain rubber.","x":0.19031140895660353,"h":0.016153148039810494},{"w":0.05201020558675129,"h":0.014806579258827335,"c":1,"t":"Test 1","y":0.05218973359999235,"x":0.85980804590924098},{"x":0.85121107317183864,"y":0.16279069745397556,"c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q31"},{"x":0.84948096964675224,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"Q35","c":1,"y":0.54360465112343548},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q36","c":1,"x":0.84948096957322283,"y":0.6468023255747436,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"t":"Q37","w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.84948096957322283,"y":0.72674418603985991},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"Q38","c":1,"y":0.8052325579209918,"x":0.84775086556418766,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"x":0.84775086556418766,"y":0.92441860473898774,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.032871971130371103,"c":1,"t":"Q39"},{"t":"101","y":0.95203488397381186,"c":1,"h":0.014534882851794828,"x":0.87543252576707709,"w":0.03114186922709139}]}